<title>GERMANY: German govt denies rumours of Kohl's death.</title>
<headline>German govt denies rumours of Kohl's death.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The German government denied market rumours on Thursday that Chancellor Helmut Kohl had died or was seriously sick.</p>
<p>A government spokesman said the talk was groundless and the Chancellor was on holiday in Austria.</p>
<p>Rumours of Kohl's ill health had unsettled European foreign exchange markets in afternoon trade.</p>
<p>--Bonn Newsroom + 49 228 260 97150</p>
</text>
